{"type":"entry","id":"eeg.phi_proxy.exec","kind":"impl","title":"EEG-derived φ proxy 5-method impl — anima_phi_v3_canonical.hexa EEG-substrate port (sample-partition φ ⭐ 1순위) + 4-method sibling (gamma synchrony / cross-channel MI / microstate / PLV) anima-eeg-core/tool/modules/_metrics/ axis","status":"in_flight","substrates":["eeg","impl","phi_proxy"],"source":"anima-eeg-core/tool/modules/_metrics/phi_proxy_native.hexa","contributes_to":["eeg.cond.4","eeg.cond.6"],"prerequisite":"eeg.blk.4 spec FROZEN + 1순위 method 결정","tier":"IMPL","tier_progression":"SPEC → IMPL (this cycle, P3 land 2026-05-03) → CROSS_VALIDATED (pending corpus run)","cycle":"2026-05-03 P3 BG aa8b98d17a565d1dc","commit":"6b9142f95","loc":1162,"verified_2026_05_03":{"sentinel":"__PHI_PROXY_NATIVE__ PASS -173702 abs_phi_x1000_le_1000000","selftest_input":"synthetic 16ch × 64 sample FNV white-noise seed=42","K_partitions":8,"ridge":1e-3,"hid_trunc":16,"phi_x1000":-173702,"phi_log_det_units":-173.702,"white_noise_sign_expectation":"phi < 0 (anti-integrated, H3A regime per anima_phi_v3)","tier":"IMPL","tier_decision":"IMPL only — selftest PASS but corpus cross-validation 0건; promotion to CROSS_VALIDATED pending ZuCo full corpus + Mistral-7B paired inference run","falsifiers_frozen":{"F_PHI_01":"phi_x1000 == sentinel (helper/Cholesky breakdown)","F_PHI_02":"|phi_x1000| > 1,000,000 (overflow guard, NOT tight scientific falsifier)","F_PHI_03":"hid_trunc not in [2, 64] (algorithm-broken)"},"honest_c3_rationale":{"summary":"user-suggested F-PHI-01 band |φ−41.86|/41.86 ≤ 0.10 NOT scientifically applicable cross-substrate","41_86_provenance":"CLM hidden-state canonical magnitude (Mistral-7B AUTO-CONDITIONING regime, anima_phi_v3_canonical.hexa)","eeg_substrate_expectation":"white-noise EEG φ ≈ −I_full (anti-integrated, H3A regime); sign-flipped + magnitude differs from CLM","fallacy_avoided":"using CLM canonical value as EEG falsifier = cross-substrate begging-the-question fallacy","f_phi_02_caveat":"|phi_x1000| > 1M = numerical overflow guard, NOT a tight scientific falsifier band","cite":"raw#10 honest C3 (substrate-specific, no glossing)"}}}
{"type":"entry","id":"eeg.phi_proxy.cross_substrate_falsifier_spec","kind":"spec","title":"F-PHI-CROSS — EEG (sample-partition) ↔ CLM (anima_phi_v3_canonical=41.86) cross-substrate consistency falsifier spec","status":"spec_pending","substrates":["eeg","clm","spec","phi_proxy","cross_substrate","falsifier"],"source":"anima-eeg-core/tool/modules/_metrics/phi_proxy_native.hexa","contributes_to":["eeg.cond.4","eeg.cond.6"],"cycle":"2026-05-03 P3 BG aa8b98d17a565d1dc","spec":{"id":"F-PHI-CROSS","comparison_axis":"φ_EEG (sample-partition φ on EEG, this entry) vs φ_CLM (anima_phi_v3_canonical=41.86, CLM hidden state)","co_aligned_stimuli":"ZuCo (EEG side) + Mistral-7B inference (CLM side) on identical sentence/word stimuli","substrate_specific_magnitude_expectation":"EEG φ < 0 (white-noise H3A anti-integrated regime) ↔ CLM φ ≈ 41.86 (auto-conditioning); magnitudes NOT directly comparable in absolute value","falsifier_threshold":"cross-stimulus rank-correlation r ≥ 0.5 (Spearman) over paired EEG-CLM φ pairs — falsifies if r < 0.5","rank_correlation_rationale":"raw#71 falsifier-bound: rank-correlation tight enough to falsify yet substrate-magnitude-agnostic (avoids CLM-band-as-EEG-falsifier fallacy per honest_c3_rationale above)","cross_link":"qmirror.cond.6 (qmirror byte-identical IIT4 cross-witness sister falsifier)","blocker":"ZuCo full corpus ETL (eeg.cond.3) + Mistral-7B paired inference path 미land","eta":"spec only this cycle, exec deferred until eeg.cond.3 ETL_LANDED + Mistral-7B paired inference impl","next_cycle_dep":["ZuCo full corpus download (~37 GB ubu1)","ETL .hexa scaffolding (raw#9 native)","Mistral-7B inference path on ZuCo stimuli","paired (EEG, CLM) φ batch run","Spearman rank-correlation harness"]}}
