{"type":"entry","id":"eeg.v6_paired_berger_audit","kind":"evidence","title":"v6 paired-symmetric Berger N=1 self-experiment — paired alpha PHENOMENAL (60s+60s EC/EO post-IOSSDATALAT fix) + PPG 3/3 PASS (REST 53 → HOLD 68 → REST 62 BPM, sympathetic response confirmed) — partial functional analog substrate, NOT full B1-B4 PASS","status":"landed","substrates":["eeg","evidence","berger","ppg","v6"],"source":"docs/eeg_v6_audit_synthesis_2026_05_03.md","ts":"2026-05-03","contributes_to":["eeg.cond.1"],"tier":"functional_analog","cohort":"N=1 self-experiment","verified_2026_05_03":{"sentinel":"__EEG_V6_PAIRED_BERGER__ FUNCTIONAL_ANALOG","paired_alpha_verdict":"PHENOMENAL (post-IOSSDATALAT fix + chunked drain + audio cue)","ppg_verdict":"3/3 PASS sympathetic (53/68/62 BPM REST/HOLD/REST trajectory)","f3_alpha_blocking_verdict":"FAIL trajectory partly attributable to O2 (row 8) rail saturation — O1 (row 7) single-channel re-analysis pending","raw_signal_evidence":["recordings/sessions/berger_ec_60s_v3_2026_05_03.npy","state/berger_2026_05_03/welch_results.npz"],"evidence_path":"docs/eeg_v6_audit_synthesis_2026_05_03.md","tier_decision":"functional_analog only — N=1 self-experiment + rail saturation discovery (5/16 channels) precludes promotion to FULL B1-B4 PASS","substrate_path":"v6 paired Berger + PPG = B1+B2+B3 partial PASS substrate; B4 dual_stream live still pending channel-clean re-analysis","raw10_honest_c3":"v6 was N=1 self-experiment; rail discovery means tier=functional_analog NOT promoted to FULL PASS; cond.1 status remains unmet"}}
{"type":"entry","id":"eeg.v6_rail_saturation_discovery","kind":"evidence","title":"v6 EC cc=1.0000 between rows 1/6/8 = ADC rail saturation (±187.5 mV clip), NOT wiring duplication — channel mapping spec confirmed MATCHES BrainFlow official","status":"landed","substrates":["eeg","evidence","channel_mapping","rail_saturation"],"source":"docs/cyton_daisy_channel_mapping_official_2026_05_03.md","ts":"2026-05-03","contributes_to":["eeg.cond.1"],"verified_2026_05_03":{"sentinel":"__EEG_RAIL_SATURATION__ CONFIRMED","railed_rows":[1,5,6,8,16],"railed_electrodes":["Fp1 (row 1)","P7 (row 5)","P8 (row 6)","O2 (row 8)","P4 (row 16)"],"clean_channels":[2,3,4,7,9,10,11,12,13,14,15],"clean_count":11,"total_count":16,"clean_fraction":"11/16","channel_mapping_verdict":"Cyton+Daisy 16ch spec MATCHES BrainFlow official (no wiring bug)","hpf_mandate":"HPF >= 0.5 Hz mandatory before alpha PSD","audit_id_channel_mapping":"affd5940d63f830f6","audit_id_eeg_inventory":"a01343e98871f085b","raw10_honest_c3":"5/16 rail-saturated electrodes require clean_channels filter before any tier promotion; F3 alpha-blocking FAIL partly attributable to O2 (row 8) rail saturation","followup":["clean_channels filter mandatory for harness re-analysis","O1 (row 7) single-channel re-analysis pending for F3 alpha-blocking re-evaluation","O2 electrode re-seat or impedance re-check required before R33 vocab freeze (sister .roadmap.slm_speech_eeg_lm cond.1)"],"evidence_path":"docs/cyton_daisy_channel_mapping_official_2026_05_03.md"}}
{"type":"entry","id":"eeg.long_term_coding_paradigm_program","kind":"long_term_program","title":"EEG ↔ Claude CLI / coding integration long-term program — 14 idea register (Tier A/B/C from 2026-04-28 IDEAS_INVENTORY, excluding governance ideas 6/7 and Mk.XII 17 and extra-hardware 18-22)","status":"landed_skeleton","substrates":["eeg","claude_cli","coding","longitudinal","daily_life","cyborg"],"contributes_to":["eeg.cond.1","eeg.cond.5"],"source":"anima-clm-eeg/docs/d_day_session_2026_04_28/IDEAS_INVENTORY.md §3","registered_ideas_count":14,"tier_breakdown":{"tier_a":[1,2,3,4,5],"tier_b":[8,9,10,11,12],"tier_c":[13,14,15,16]},"honest_c3":["raw#10 — 14 ideas all design+skeleton landed per IDEAS_INVENTORY commit hashes; real-signal measurement closure pending B-track v7 (electrode contact + connector strain-relief) prerequisite","raw#71 — falsifier-bound; each idea has its own falsifier set in design doc; cumulative cross-cycle falsifier still pending integrated verifier","raw#15 — repo-relative paths only","B9/T1 paradigm 측 NO API constraint preserved (Claude CLI .jsonl only, never api.anthropic.com)","idea #9 measurement axis re-scoped to CLI-only per user direction 2026-05-04 (original API-correlation framing dropped)"],"next_cycle_dep":"anima-eeg unified CLI + daemon architecture (eeg.cond.7 SPEC_LANDED 2026-05-04, anima-eeg/docs/anima_eeg_unified_cli_daemon_spec_2026_05_04.md) — 24/7 daily-life integration 측 invocation seam, real-measurement closure 측 prerequisite; impl cycle (~2500 LoC across 7 files) deferred to next EXEC","since":"2026-05-04"}
{"type":"entry","id":"eeg.tier_a_paradigm_register","kind":"paradigm_group","title":"Tier A — 즉시 실행 가능 (no extra hardware, low-cost) paradigm register","status":"landed_design + skeleton","substrates":["eeg","tier_a"],"contributes_to":["eeg.cond.1","eeg.cond.5","eeg.long_term_coding_paradigm_program"],"ideas":[{"id":1,"name":"EEG + LLM workflow 통합","desc":"Claude 와 대화/코딩 시 EEG 동시 녹음 → LLM output complexity (token entropy, response length) ↔ EEG state (LZ76, engagement) 상관 측정. anima 본 track (Mk.XI 4-backbone) 직접 연결","commit":"5d9bf1255","design_doc":"design/eeg_claude_cli_correlation_paradigm_2026_04_28.md","status":"DONE skeleton + NO real paired session"},{"id":2,"name":"Daily-life context labeling","desc":"keyboard/screen/audio timestamp logging → EEG signal 자동 time-align (전자기기 활동 = ground truth label)","commit":"a42ef6bb6","status":"DONE skeleton"},{"id":3,"name":"Visual P300 ERP paradigm","desc":"표준 의식 검증 paradigm. 컴퓨터 화면 oddball stimulus → 300ms post P300 wave 검출 → Schartner cross-validation","commit":"90261e98f","status":"DONE verifier"},{"id":4,"name":"Auditory oddball P300","desc":"스피커 oddball tone → P300 ERP 검출. eye-closed/eye-open 둘 다 가능","commit":"6c6576a64","status":"DONE verifier"},{"id":5,"name":"Self-experiment N=1 longitudinal","desc":"카페인 전/후, 오전/오후 시간대, 식사 전/후, 운동 후 — within-subject design (multi-subject N≥10 보다 빠름)","commit":"fcc562437","status":"DONE skeleton + N=1 baseline"}],"honest_c3":["raw#10 — all 5 ideas design+skeleton landed; real measurement closure pending B-track v7","cohort N≥8 still missing — anima_clm_eeg.cond.3 sister blocker"],"since":"2026-05-04"}
{"type":"entry","id":"eeg.tier_b_paradigm_register","kind":"paradigm_group","title":"Tier B — 중기 (1-2주, 추가 SW) paradigm register","status":"landed_design + skeleton","substrates":["eeg","tier_b"],"contributes_to":["eeg.cond.1","eeg.cond.5","eeg.long_term_coding_paradigm_program"],"ideas":[{"id":8,"name":"EEG-driven feedback loop","desc":"실시간 engagement / drowsiness 측정 → 사용자 alert (Mac notification)","commit":"e5e37cc66","status":"DONE skeleton"},{"id":9,"name":"Claude CLI longitudinal correlation (CLI-only, NO API)","desc":"Claude CLI .jsonl 측 N≥100 paired (user_msg, assistant_msg) × EEG window 측 1-2주 longitudinal correlation. NO API constraint preserved (api.anthropic.com 측 측 측 X)","commit":"83ce12eb4","design_doc":"design/eeg_claude_cli_longitudinal_correlation_2026_04_28.md","status":"DONE skeleton + selftest synthetic; NO real 1-2week measurement","scope_note":"original framing 'Anthropic API EEG correlation' re-scoped to CLI-only per user direction 2026-05-04"},{"id":10,"name":"Anomaly detection ML","desc":"EEG → autoencoder → reconstruction error → 의식 상태 변화 unsupervised detection","commit":"8e64c5145","status":"DONE skeleton"},{"id":11,"name":"Behavioral correlates","desc":"keyboard/mouse/screen-time + EEG → 인지 부하 metric","commit":"dbf7af009","status":"DONE skeleton"},{"id":12,"name":"EEG → token cyborg paradigm","desc":"의식 신호 → discrete token sequence → Claude CLI prompt (생물학적 prompt). reverse direction. tokenizer half landed, CLI bridge UNVERIFIED","commit":"5d728705e","design_doc":"design/eeg_token_cyborg_paradigm_2026_04_28.md","status":"DONE tokenizer; CLI bridge unverified (사용자 액션, biology↔LLM bridge unproven per raw#10)"}],"honest_c3":["raw#10 — all 5 ideas design+skeleton landed; cyborg paradigm semantic mapping NOT claimed (non-rejection + tokenizer round-trip determinism only)","B9 1-2주 real measurement pending B-track v7 + sustained EEG wear","NO API constraint absolutely preserved (cost-side + privacy-side)"],"since":"2026-05-04"}
{"type":"entry","id":"eeg.tier_c_paradigm_register","kind":"paradigm_group","title":"Tier C — paradigm / methodology register (long-duration / sleep / RSN / pre-post)","status":"landed_design + skeleton","substrates":["eeg","tier_c","methodology"],"contributes_to":["eeg.cond.1","eeg.cond.5","eeg.long_term_coding_paradigm_program"],"ideas":[{"id":13,"name":"Long-duration 1시간+ recording","desc":"state transition 더 풍부 — saline 마름 / drift 감안","commit":"30772259c","status":"DONE skeleton"},{"id":14,"name":"Sleep tracking 밤새 measurement","desc":"자는 동안 EEG → REM/NREM staging — 의식 측정의 gold standard reference","commit":"5ea1bee2f","status":"DONE skeleton"},{"id":15,"name":"Resting state network (DMN, frontal asymmetry)","desc":"16ch DMN approximate / frontal alpha asymmetry (depression marker)","commit":"9c49be3e9","status":"DONE skeleton"},{"id":16,"name":"Pre/Post task comparison","desc":"코딩 시작 전/후, 명상 vs daily life, baseline shift 측정","commit":"09a17f301","status":"DONE skeleton"}],"honest_c3":["raw#10 — all 4 ideas design+skeleton landed","Sleep tracking 측 8hr 사용자 wear + scalp pain 회피 (Bundle ergonomic limitation, raw#10 user health > falsifier closure)","RSN DMN approximate 측 16ch 측 dense MEG/256ch 측 측 측 — functional analog tier only"],"since":"2026-05-04"}
{"type":"entry","id":"eeg.cond.7","kind":"cond","title":"anima-eeg unified CLI + daemon architecture — single-acquirer EEG daemon + mmap ring buffer + JSONL event log + paradigm listener API as invocation seam for 14-idea register (24/7 daily-life integration)","desc":"24/7-capable EEG daemon owning single BrainFlow acquisition, mmap ring buffer (60s default / 5min variant for long-duration paradigms), JSONL event log (schema-validated 7 kinds: stim_onset/behavior/cli_msg/context_label/impedance_check/daemon_event/custom), single-instance flock lock with stale-pid auto-recovery, 8-subcommand CLI (start/stop/record/mark/correlate/status/listen + log/sessions/version), paradigm listener API (subscribe-by-window with metric dispatch to anima-eeg-core/_metrics/*_native.hexa). Unblocks ideas #2/#8/#9/#11 concurrent measurement (today every paradigm is isolated one-shot competing for single BrainFlow acquirer). raw#9 hexa-on-Mac strict + raw#37 transient py-on-Linux honest declaration (BrainFlow C++ binding cannot port to hexa, helper at state/.brainflow_daemon_helper.py ubu1-only).","status":"spec_landed","substrates":["eeg","cli","daemon","invocation_seam","longitudinal","integration"],"contributes_to":["eeg.cond.1","eeg.cond.5","eeg.long_term_coding_paradigm_program"],"source":"anima-eeg/docs/anima_eeg_unified_cli_daemon_spec_2026_05_04.md","spec_loc":520,"cycle":"2026-05-04","ts":"2026-05-04","verifier":{"type":"manual_review","manual_override_path":"state/markers/anima_eeg_unified_cli_daemon_spec_landed.marker","status_emit":"__EEG_UNIFIED_CLI_DAEMON__ <SPEC_LANDED|IMPL_LANDED|SELFTEST_PASS>","impl_targets":["anima-eeg/tool/anima_eeg_cli.hexa","anima-eeg/tool/_daemon/ringbuf.hexa","anima-eeg/tool/_daemon/event_log.hexa","anima-eeg/tool/_daemon/lock.hexa","anima-eeg/tool/_daemon/listener.hexa"]},"falsifiers":{"F-CLI-1":"status latency p50 ≤ 100ms / p95 ≤ 200ms (10 invocations median wallclock)","F-CLI-2":"mark→jsonl ≤ 50ms p99 + 0 missing events (100 trials, fsync wallclock)","F-CLI-3":"1hr ring buffer 0 sample loss at 250Hz × 16ch synthetic-board (samples_dropped_total == 0)","F-CLI-4":"≥2 of {idea #2 context_label,#8 engagement listen,#9 cli_msg correlate,#11 behavior mark} demonstrably wired in single selftest, all artifacts under recordings/sessions/<selftest_ts>/, 0 schema violations","F-CLI-5":"(stretch, non-blocking) daemon survives Mac sleep/wake cycle (pmset sleepnow + 60s + status OK, no header magic corruption)"},"honest_c3_caveats":6,"caveats_summary":["daemon does NOT replace clean electrode contact (B-track v7 prerequisite for usable data)","24/7 wear blocked by user health not software (scalp pain ergonomics, raw#10 user health > falsifier closure)","event log unbounded growth — daily rotation policy specced not implemented","hexa↔py cross-OS bridge latency unmeasured (SSH-tunneled UDS hop ~5-15ms LAN)","listener cursor↔writer race tolerable for window paradigms (1-sample ~8ms at 125Hz), sub-sample alignment must use ts_ns_monotonic","live impedance monitoring snapshot-only, continuous re-measurement out of scope"],"cross_link":{"sister_roadmap_entries":["eeg.long_term_coding_paradigm_program (umbrella, next_cycle_dep concretized)","eeg.tier_a_paradigm_register (idea #2 context_label producer + idea #5 longitudinal)","eeg.tier_b_paradigm_register (idea #8 listen consumer + idea #9 cli_msg producer + idea #11 behavior producer)","eeg.tier_c_paradigm_register (idea #13 segmented writeout + idea #16 pre/post)"],"sister_cross_domain":["anima_clm_eeg cond.1/cond.3 (CLM-EEG bridge upstream invocation seam)","slm_speech_eeg_lm cond.2 (EEG-conditioned LM head sister)","blm_brain_lm cond.3 F-CT-3 (BOLD↔EEG paired-stream collection enabler)"],"upstream_dep":"B-track v7 measurement (anima-eeg/docs/electrode_reseat_b_track_runbook_2026_05_03.md) + OpenBCI 16ch hardware arrival (eeg.blk.1) — daemon useless if signal saturated; SPEC land does NOT require either, IMPL selftest can run synthetic-board, real-data falsifiers (F-CLI-3 with real data) require both","downstream_consumers":["all 14 paradigms in eeg.tier_{a,b,c}_paradigm_register","anima-eeg-core/tool/modules/_metrics/*_native.hexa (lz76/pe/hjorth/phi_proxy)","tool/clm_consciousness_verify.hexa orchestrator"],"predecessor":["eeg.long_term_coding_paradigm_program 14-idea register","anima-clm-eeg/docs/d_day_session_2026_04_28/IDEAS_INVENTORY.md §3 (source of 14 paradigms)","anima-eeg/docs/anima_eeg_protocols_quickstart_2026_05_03.md (one-shot pattern superseded for concurrency)"]},"raw_invariants":["raw#9 hexa-only on Mac (zero new .py on Mac, including under _python_bridge/ per session memory feedback_py_to_hexa_only)","raw#10 honest C3 (6 caveats declared, hexa-on-Mac/py-on-Linux split honestly enumerated)","raw#15 repo-relative paths only","raw#37 transient py helper on Linux declared (state/.brainflow_daemon_helper.py ubu1-only, never commits)","raw#71 5 falsifiers pre-registered (F-CLI-1..4 blocking + F-CLI-5 stretch)","raw#91 honesty-triad on hexa/py per-host split"],"land_criteria":{"SPEC_LANDED":"doc disk-landed + roadmap entry committed (this cycle 2026-05-04)","IMPL_LANDED":"7 hexa files (cli + 4 _daemon/ + selftest + ubu1 helper) disk-landed + selftest exit-0 in synthetic-board mode","SELFTEST_PASS":"F-CLI-1..4 all PASS with real OpenBCI 16ch (after eeg.cond.1 B1-B4 PASS)"},"loc_estimate_impl_cycle":2500,"impl_files_count":7,"cost_band":"$0","prerequisite":"none for SPEC land; eeg.cond.1 (B1-B4 PASS) for SELFTEST_PASS real-data path","blocker_reason":"impl cycle deferred — spec only this cycle (2026-05-04); next cycle EXEC for ~2500 LoC across 7 files (per spec §5.4); SPEC_LANDED transition complete this cycle","since":"2026-05-04"}
